- school-portals.ts: per-student LMS+email store, mirrored to .nemesis/portals.json
  for the agent; Connections gets an editable 'Your school' card (Blackboard/Canvas/
  Brightspace/…), replacing the hardcoded UTHSC row. Today reads the same list.
- Library: collapsible file list (persisted), browser-style back/forward over visit
  history (Cmd+[ / Cmd+]), Cmd+N new note, empty-state New note button.
- ActivityStrip: model intent line (suppresses meta-narration) + live status phrase +
  'Worked/Thought for Xs' settled collapse; running trail hidden except approval cards.
- Tests: extractIntent (7), nav-history (3).
